This tree is a Linux kernel for Android GKI, plus ROOTURK packaging scripts.

The kernel (`kernel/`) is licensed under the GNU General Public License v2.
See kernel/COPYING and https://www.kernel.org/doc/html/latest/process/license-rules.html

ROOTURK scripts, AnyKernel wrapper text, and documentation in this repository
are provided under GPL-2.0-only, the same terms as the kernel they build.

KernelSU Next is included under kernel/KernelSU-Next/ and keeps its own license
file.

